  "design": {
    "idea": "ASTONISHING \u2014 THE CATOPTRIC MIRROR-DRUM: align Focal Mirror M1 (225 deg), Relay Mirror M2 (45 deg), and floating East Moat Raft R1 (225 deg), then fire ONE yellow bolt into M1 so the 3-way Prism Split cascades simultaneously into West Eye (-18 deg), East Eye (+18 deg), and through M2 -> R1 -> North Eye (0 deg 3-bounce chain!), igniting Optic Well W3 (relay_f3)!",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ketsu",
    "teaches": "Synthesizing Prism Split 3-way fans with multi-bounce mirror-raft relays in a single simultaneous optical circuit.",
    "decisions": 12,
    "expert_s": 66,
    "reward": "relay_f3+lens_loft_and_nave_access",
    "why": "Grand astonishing optical puzzle centerpiece of The Lighthouse.",
